    'about.hero.label':'The practice','about.hero.h1':'About',
    'about.hero.p':'Stéphane Magre is a landscape architect, graduate of the École Nationale Supérieure du Paysage de Versailles. He designs and oversees bespoke gardens and landscapes in France and internationally — from first sketch to completion.',
    'about.intro.label':'Philosophy',
    'about.intro.lead':'My work rests on a close reading of the site — its topography, its geography, its living heritage. Every project is born from this attention to place and to the living world.',
