    'about.role.label.2':'The collaboration','about.role.h2.2':'Architects, interior designers<br>and urban planners.',
    'about.role.p1.2':'I collaborate with architects, interior designers, and urban planners to create singular outdoor spaces. Complementary by nature, this shared work brings a creative and intellectual contribution that nourishes the projects.',
    'about.role.p2.2':'These collaborations make it possible to operate at the same level as the practices I work with — on private residences as on large international projects.',
    'about.portrait.label':'Background','about.portrait.h2':'Trained in landscape,<br>shaped by practice.',
    'about.portrait.p1':'I hold the diploma of Paysagiste DPLG from the École Nationale Supérieure du Paysage de Versailles — with a diploma project devoted to the park of Saint-Cloud. I completed my education abroad, in contexts that substantially shaped my approach to landscape thinking.',
